height":1024,"1536x1536":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_14-e1650539361678-1025x1536.jpg","1536x1536-width":1025,"1536x1536-height":1536,"2048x2048":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_14-e1650539361678.jpg","2048x2048-width":1334,"2048x2048-height":2000}}},{"bildfil":{"ID":143,"id":143,"title":"SPILL_10","filename":"SPILL_10.jpg","filesize":770784,"url":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10.jpg","link":"https:\/\/restaurangspill.se\/startsida\/spill_10\/","alt":"","author":"1","description":"","caption":"","name":"spill_10","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":12,"date":"2022-04-21 10:00:51","modified":"2022-04-21 10:00:51","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image\/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-includes\/images\/media\/default.png","width":1334,"height":2000,"sizes":{"thumbnail":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10-150x150.jpg","thumbnail-width":150,"thumbnail-height":150,"medium":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10-200x300.jpg","medium-width":200,"medium-height":300,"medium_large":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10-768x1151.jpg","medium_large-width":768,"medium_large-height":1151,"large":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10-683x1024.jpg","large-width":683,"large-height":1024,"1536x1536":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10-1025x1536.jpg","1536x1536-width":1025,"1536x1536-height":1536,"2048x2048":"https:\/\/cms.restaurangspill.se\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/04\/SPILL_10.jpg","2048x2048-width":1334,"2048x2048-height":2000}}}],"catering":"<p>Vi har m\u00e5nga \u00e5rs erfarenhet av catering, allt fr\u00e5n br\u00f6llop till invigningar. \u00d6nskar du att fokusera p\u00e5 g\u00e4sterna och slippa t\u00e4nka p\u00e5 maten s\u00e5 anlita g\u00e4rna oss!<\/p>\n<p>Det finns o\u00e4ndligt med olika uppl\u00e4gg n\u00e4r det kommer till middagar s\u00e5 tveka inte att h\u00f6ra av er med era \u00f6nskem\u00e5l.<\/p>\n<p>Eftersom vi jobbar med att r\u00e4dda matsvinn s\u00e5 \u00e4r det sv\u00e5rt f\u00f6r oss att ge exakta menyf\u00f6rslag. D\u00e4rf\u00f6r har vi skrivit ihop ett antal r\u00e4tter f\u00f6r att ge er en k\u00e4nsla av hur det kan se ut.<\/p>\n<p>F\u00f6rutom dagens lunch s\u00e5 erbjuder vi \u00e4ven:<\/p>\n<p>Frukost med macka &amp; smootie 90 kr \/ person<br \/>\nWraps 95 kr \/ person<br \/>\nBowl 130 kr \/ person<br \/>\nSm\u00f6rg\u00e5st\u00e5rta 125 kr \/ person ( min 10 pers)<br \/>\nSallad 120 kr \/ person<br \/>\nTapastallrik 220 kr \/ person<br \/>\nMingeltallrik 220 kr \/ person<\/p>\n<p>Buff\u00e9:<br \/>\n4 alternativ 300 kr \/ person<br \/>\n5 alternativ 350 kr \/ person<\/p>\n<p>Minimun 10 personer<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kyckling, yoghurt, gurka, vitl\u00f6k<\/li>\n<li>Lax, dill, f\u00e4nk\u00e5l, senapsfr\u00f6<\/li>\n<li>Tomat, krutonger, basilika, citron<\/li>\n<li>Spetsk\u00e5l, brynt miso, yuzo<\/li>\n<li>Tunt skuren biff, tonnatokr\u00e4m, kapris, parmesan<\/li>\n<li>Zucchini, rostade fr\u00f6n, grillad citron<\/li>\n<li>Kalv, svamp, sesam, vallmo<\/li>\n<li>Grillad bl\u00e4ckfisk, krispig sallad, persilja, aioli, citron<\/li>\n<li>Tonfisk, soja, lime, pak choi<\/li>\n<li>Gulbeta, getost, picklad gr\u00f6n tomat<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Tilltugg:<br \/>\n55 kr tilltugg \/ person<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quesadillas, ost, jalapeno, gr\u00e4sl\u00f6k<\/li>\n<li>Friterad potatis, rom, syrlig kr\u00e4m<\/li>\n<li>Knaprigt r\u00e5dbr\u00f6d, lagrad ost och tomatmarmelad<\/li>\n<li>Salladsknyte, sockersaltad lax, syrlig l\u00f6k &amp; majonn\u00e4s<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Dessert:<br \/>\n95 kr \/ person\u00a0 serveras i glas<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bakad chokladkr\u00e4m med hjortronsylt och havrekrisp<\/li>\n<li>\u00c4pple, karamell, hasseln\u00f6t<\/li>\n<li>Tiramisu<\/li>\n<li>Italiensk mar\u00e4ng &amp; citron<\/li>\n<li>salt kolapaj &amp; choklad<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","koncept":"<p>Restaurang Spill serverar mat som till stor del best\u00e5r av r\u00e5varor som egentligen skulle kastas, men som vi ist\u00e4llet k\u00f6per in och tar tillvara p\u00e5.<\/p>\n<p>Hur ser d\u00e5 en vanlig dag ut f\u00f6r er? <\/p>\n<p>Jo, vi best\u00e4mmer samma morgon som lunchen ska serveras, exakt hur lunchen ska se ut. D\u00e4rf\u00f6r har vi inga veckomenyer och d\u00e4rf\u00f6r tvekar en del att f\u00f6rbest\u00e4lla hos oss. <\/p>\n<p>Allt vi serverar hos oss \u00e4r tillagat med k\u00e4nsla och k\u00e4rlek. Det \u00e4r n\u00e4mligen det r\u00e5varor beh\u00f6ver som inte \"looks perfect\". <\/p>\n","oppettider":"<p>M\u00e5ndag - Fredag<\/p>\n<p>08.00-10.00 Frukost (hyllie)<br \/>\n11.00-14.00 Lunch<\/p>\n<p>Restaurangerna \u00e4r \u00f6ppna f\u00f6r fika hela dagen fram till kl. 15.30! <\/p>\n","kontakt":"<p>Restaurang Spill p\u00e5 DOCKAN<br \/>\nG\u00e4ngtappen, Stora Varvsgatan 11<br \/>\n211 74, Malm\u00f6<\/p>\n<p>Restaurang Spill i HYLLIE<br \/>\nSkrivaregatan 21<br \/>\n215 32 Malm\u00f6 <\/p>\n<p>Vid bords-bokning p\u00e5 HYLLIE & DOCKAN , maila Ellinor@restaurangspill.se eller ring Erik p\u00e5 0737070813<br \/>\nVi tar emot bordsbokningar 11.30 eller 12.15  <\/p>\n<p>Vid fr\u00e5gor om catering och \u00f6vriga best\u00e4llningar, maila Ellinor@restaurangspill.se <\/p>\n","datum_hyllie":"20261124","dagens_primar_hyllie":"Nattbakad grissida med gremolata, \u00f6rtig potatisstomp, \u00e4pple & l\u00f6k <br \/>\r\n(finns fl\u00e4skfritt)","dagens_veg_hyllie":"Bakad tomat & marinerade linser. Serveras med gremolata, \u00f6rtig potatisstomp, \u00e4pple & l\u00f6k <br \/>\r\n(finns vegansk)<br \/>\r\n<br \/>\r\nVarmt v\u00e4lkommen ","dagens_pris_hyllie":"135","andel_svinn_hyllie":"91","bannertext":"Nu g\u00e5r det bra att best\u00e4lla Ny\u00e5rsmeny fr\u00e5n oss !","lankmal":"","aktivera":true,"dagens_primar_engelska":"Wallenbergare with mashed potatoes, melted butter, lingonberries  & green peas","dagens_veg_engelska":"Vegetable patty with mashed potatoes, melted butter, lingonberries  and green peas\r\nAvailable as a vegan option <3","dagens_primar_hyllie_engelska":"Slow-roasted pork belly with gremolata, herb-infused mashed potatoes, apple, and onion","dagens_veg_hyllie_engelska":"Baked tomato & marinated lentils. Served with gremolata, herb-infused mashed potatoes, apple & onion.\r\nVegen option is available "}}